		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Hidden Mine</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — A concealed mine that detonates when an enemy steps near.</em></p><p><strong>Reaction:</strong> When an enemy enters a space in Range 6. Damage: STRd8 Force on a failed DEX save, half on success. Adjacent enemies take equal damage. Ignores armor.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> The first target is launched back INT spaces on a failed save if they are Large or smaller.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You take half damage from your own explosives.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Same DEX save / STRd8 Force (half on save) as the base activation.</em></p><p><em>[M] On a failed save, launch the first target (Large or smaller) INT spaces away.</em></p>",
